Experimental sherpa-ONNX CPU session build

Upstream sherpa-ONNX: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx, tag v1.13.4.
The CPU session patch is distributed under the upstream Apache-2.0 license.
The native wheel also includes dependencies with their own licenses, including
eSpeak NG under GPLv3. It is not an Apache-only dependency bundle.
The accompanying build-sources archive contains the patched sherpa sources and
all fetched native dependency source trees used for this build, with their
license/copyright notices. ONNX Runtime is an upstream prebuilt MIT-licensed
dependency; its included headers, binaries and license are retained.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.tar.gz for a convenient copy of dependency notices.
No Orukeet model weights or user audio are included.
